{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicTransversal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicTransversal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterReflectionCocycle","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeDihedralBraidReduction"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.braid_at_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.braid_at_pair","kind":"theorem","line":425,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L425-L437","doc":"**THE PAYOFF — the braid relation at general rank, from the Coxeter\nsystem**: on the length-rule module `W → R`, the right-multiplication\ndescent actions of any `M i j = 3` pair satisfy the braid relation, given\nonly the cell-faithfulness residue. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:coxeter-parabolic-transversal","label":"prop:coxeter-parabolic-transversal","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/coxeter-parabolic-transversal.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.dihedralTransversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.dihedralTransversal","kind":"def","line":380,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L380-L423","doc":"**The dihedral coset structure of any `M i j = 3` pair**, constructed\nfrom the Coxeter system modulo the single faithfulness residue\n`IsReduced [i, j, i]`. The braid reduction's coset hypothesis, discharged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap3_bijective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap3_bijective","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L341-L376","doc":"**The parabolic factorization is a bijection.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap3","kind":"def","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L336-L339","doc":"The factorization map `(min reps) × Fin 6 → W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isMinRep_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isMinRep_unique","kind":"theorem","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L317-L334","doc":"**Each coset has a unique minimal representative.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.length_minRep_mul_cell3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.length_minRep_mul_cell3","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L309-L315","doc":"Length additivity of a minimal representative against a cell element\n(the unconditional lifting lemma, specialised). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mem_parabolic3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mem_parabolic3","kind":"theorem","line":283,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L283-L305","doc":"**`W_{i,j}` is exactly the six cell elements** — closure induction on\nleft multiplication. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell3_mul_simple_j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell3_mul_simple_j","kind":"theorem","line":258,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L258-L279","doc":"Right multiplication by `σⱼ` is the `descentH3σ₁` table (two\nbraid-bearing entries). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell3_mul_simple_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell3_mul_simple_i","kind":"theorem","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L237-L256","doc":"Right multiplication by `σᵢ` is the `descentH3σ₀` table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_j_mul_cell3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_j_mul_cell3","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L215-L235","doc":"Left multiplication by `σⱼ` permutes the cell by `![2, 3, 0, 1, 5, 4]`\n(two braid-bearing entries). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_i_mul_cell3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_i_mul_cell3","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L196-L213","doc":"Left multiplication by `σᵢ` permutes the cell by `![1, 0, 4, 5, 2, 3]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem3_injective","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L155-L192","doc":"The six cell elements are pairwise distinct, given the faithfulness\nresidue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellWord3_isReduced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellWord3_isReduced","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L144-L153","doc":"Every cell word is reduced, given the faithfulness residue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_nil","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L140-L142","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_single","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicTransversal.lean#L136-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ji","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ji","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-unive